## Acciones [/{account}/lists/{id}/{action}]

+ Parameters
    + account: testaccount (string, required)
    + id: 1 (number, required)

### Clean [POST /{account}/lists/{id}/clean]
Limpia los contactos de una lista, según el criterio indicado. Pueden indicarse uno o varios criterios en simultáneo. El resultado es la UNION de los criterios, no la intersección.

+ Request (application/x-www-form-urlencoded)

    + Attributes
        + bounced (boolean, optional) - Limpia contactos marcados como rebotados.
        + complained (boolean, optional) - Limpia contactos marcados con quejas.
        + unsubscribed (boolean, optional) - Limpia contactos marcados como desuscriptos. 
        + inactiveDays (boolean, optional) - Limpia contactos que no demuestran actividad en los últimos N días, o no tienen actividad alguna. 
        + quality (boolean, optional) -  Limpia los contactos con calidad menor o igual a N, 0<=N<=1. 
        + action: remove (enum[string], optional) - Indica que hacer con los contactos que coinciden con el criterio.
            + Members
                + `delete`
                + `remove`
    
    + Headers

            Authorization: Bearer API_KEY
            X-Auth-Token: access_token
  
+ Response 200  (application/json)

        {
            "url": "/myaccount/lists/1/clean",
            "success" : true,
            "task": {
                "id": 556342,
                "type": "LIST_CLEAN",
                "name": "Limpieza de lista 1",
                "state": "QUEUED",
                "cancellable": false,
                "message": "Pendiente de ejecución",
                "owner": "myuser",
                "created": "2014-05-20T10:23:04-0300",
                "init": null,
                "end": null,
                "completed": 0,
                "eta": null,
                "request": "/myaccount/lists/123/split",
                "parameters": {
                    "action": "DELETE",
                    "bounced": true
                },
                "result": null
            }
        }

### Split [POST /{account}/lists/{id}/split]
Divide la lista según el criterio indicado. 

+ Request (application/x-www-form-urlencoded)

    + Attributes
        + numLists: 2 (number, required) - Indica la cantidad de listas resultantes. Los contactos se dividen en partes iguales, ajustando en alguna lista si la cantidad de contactos no es divisible. min=2, max=100
    
    + Headers

            Authorization: Bearer API_KEY
            X-Auth-Token: access_token
 
+ Response 200  (application/json)

        {
            "url": "/myaccount/lists/1/split",
            "success" : true,
            "task": {
                "id": 556342,
                "type": "LIST_SPLIT",
                "name": "Limpieza de lista 1",
                "state": "QUEUED",
                "cancellable": false,
                "message": "Pendiente de ejecución",
                "owner": "myuser",
                "created": "2014-05-20T10:23:04-0300",
                "init": null,
                "end": null,
                "completed": 0,
                "eta": null,
                "request": "/myaccount/lists/123/split",
                "parameters": {
                    "numLists": 2
                },
                "result": null
            }
        }

### Duplicate [POST /{account}/lists/{id}/duplicate]
Duplica una lista, creando una nueva.

+ Request (application/x-www-form-urlencoded)

    + Attributes
        + newListName: Copia de Lista A (string, required) - Nombre de la nueva lista.
    
    + Headers

            Authorization: Bearer API_KEY
            X-Auth-Token: access_token
 
+ Response 200  (application/json)

        {
            "url": "/myaccount/lists/1/duplicate",
            "success" : true,
            "task": {
                "id": 556342,
                "type": "LIST_DUPLICATE",
                "name": "Duplicado de lista 1",
                "state": "QUEUED",
                "cancellable": false,
                "message": "Pendiente de ejecución",
                "owner": "myuser",
                "created": "2014-05-20T10:23:04-0300",
                "init": null,
                "end": null,
                "completed": 0,
                "eta": null,
                "request": "/myaccount/lists/123/duplicate",
                "parameters": {
                    "newListName": "Copia de 1"
                },
                "result": null
            }
        }


### Substract [POST /{account}/lists/{id}/substract]
Saca de una lista los contactos que aparecen en otras listas.

+ Request (application/x-www-form-urlencoded)

    + Attributes
        + substractListIds: [2,3] (array[], required) - Id de las listas para realizar la resta.
    
    + Headers

            Authorization: Bearer API_KEY
            X-Auth-Token: access_token
 
+ Response 200  (application/json)

        {
            "url": "/myaccount/lists/1/substract",
            "success" : true,
            "task": {
                "id": 556342,
                "type": "LIST_SUBSTRACT",
                "name": "Sustracción de lista 1",
                "state": "QUEUED",
                "cancellable": false,
                "message": "Pendiente de ejecución",
                "owner": "myuser",
                "created": "2014-05-20T10:23:04-0300",
                "init": null,
                "end": null,
                "completed": 0,
                "eta": null,
                "request": "/myaccount/lists/123/substract",
                "parameters": {
                    "substractListIds": [2,3]
                },
                "result": null
            }
        }
 


### Sample [POST /{account}/lists/{id}/sample]
Toma una muestra random de N contactos de una lista, creando una lista nueva.

+ Request (application/x-www-form-urlencoded)

    + Attributes
       + newListName: Copia de Lista A (string, required) - Nombre de la nueva lista.
       + sampleSize: 4000 (number, required) - Indica la cantidad de contactos a obtener del muestreo.

    
    + Headers

            Authorization: Bearer API_KEY
            X-Auth-Token: access_token
 
+ Response 200  (application/json)

        {
            "url": "/myaccount/lists/1/sample",
            "success" : true,
            "task": {
                "id": 556342,
                "type": "LIST_SAMPLE",
                "name": "Muestra de lista 1",
                "state": "QUEUED",
                "cancellable": false,
                "message": "Pendiente de ejecución",
                "owner": "myuser",
                "created": "2014-05-20T10:23:04-0300",
                "init": null,
                "end": null,
                "completed": 0,
                "eta": null,
                "request": "/myaccount/lists/123/sample",
                "parameters": {
                    "newListName": "Muestra de lista 1",
                    "sampleSize": 1000
                },
                "result": null
            }
        }

 
